//-->
    </script>@old_pirate: can you provide more details about the porting process (and was it AI-assisted or not) ?    <script type="text/javascript">      
<!--
        document.write('</div>');      
//-->
    </script>  </div></blockquote>
<br />
While I relied solely on my own intuition when creating <a href="https://old-pirate.itch.io/battle-city-sms" target="_blank" class="postlink">Battle City</a>, this time I made use of the game's decompilation for the NES. I also utilized AI, which guided me on how to implement a light gun for the SMS. Furthermore, the AI ​​handled the sound effects—a task I personally dislike the most when it comes to video game development.<br />
